cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to RC Surface in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RC Surface"
abstract: >-
  Source-available Ableton Live 12 extension that turns a phone's web browser
  into a wireless controller: performance pads, XY pads, knobs, faders, LFOs,
  stutters, snapshots with vector morph, motion sensors, audio descriptors and
  single-hand camera tracking, mapped to Live parameters or MIDI notes over the
  local network.
authors:
